              "protocol": "http",
              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "port": "8080",
              "path": [
                "api",
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create a new order - triggers the saga orchestration\nExpected: Order created with PENDING status, later moves to CONFIRMED if inventory is available"
